<title>USA: TABLE - Geneva Steel Co Q3 June 30 profit.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Geneva Steel Co Q3 June 30 profit.</headline>
<dateline>VINEYARD, Utah 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.08     loss	 $0.43</p>
<p> Net profit		 3,962     loss	 4,360</p>
<p> Sales		    194,089		  183,105</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  15,831		   15,319</p>
<p>		     Nine Months</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.68     loss	 $1.12</p>
<p> Net loss		   2,951     loss	10,377</p>
<p> Sales		    546,791		  509,326</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  15,598		   15,284</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q3 net includes an $875,000 gain from tax loss carry forward.</p>
<p>Per share after preferred dividend requirements of $2.6 million vs $2.3 million in quarter and $7.6 million vs $6.7 million in nine months.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
